<title>RUSSIA: Russia auctions 11 trln rbls t-bills, bonds Jan 29.</title>
<headline>Russia auctions 11 trln rbls t-bills, bonds Jan 29.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry will auction 7.00 trillion roubles of 273-day GKO discount Treasury bills and a new 504-day 4.00 trillion rouble tranche of OFZ government bonds on January 29, the central bank said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Full details of the T-bill auction:</p>
<p>    Series number		 22069</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   7.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		  1.00 million rbls</p>
<p>    Tenor			   273 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		    January 29, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity			October 29, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the additional bond tranche issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		 24010</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   4.00 trln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations		  1.00 million rbls</p>
<p>    Tenor (remaining)	   504 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		    January 29, 1997</p>
<p>    Original issue date	 December 18, 1996</p>
<p>    Maturity			June 17, 1998</p>
<p>On January 29, the Finance Ministry will also repay 6.6 trillion roubles in maturing six-month T-bills (series 22040).</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
